            You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> what he’s been into recently. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Watched wrestling the other day, that was pretty dope. The Heartbreaker did this crazy ass move, can’t even describe it. But it was like a massive flip and then he grabbed the other guy by the throat and-”</span>  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> does on to recount this match with you. It did sound pretty cool… until <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> asked to ‘practice’ some of the moves on you. <br>
